Description: Implement ssl_recvall and ssl_sendall
 Backport of upstream fix: SSL_read/SSL_write may transfer fewer bytes
  than requested; adds ssl_recvall/ssl_sendall which loop with select()
  until the packet is fully transferred or the timeout expires, fixing
  truncated or missing responses on non-blocking sockets
  (adjusted to 4.1.3 context).
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/NagiosEnterprises/nrpe/commit/846a01acd8133bbe64e669baac5104638d7a78a8
Forwarded: not-needed
